      "author_user_id": 11,
      "timestamp_iso": "2012-09-26T16:21:08+00:00",
      "timestamp_epoch_ms": 1348676468000,
      "timestamp_raw": "Sept 26, 2012 11:21:08 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "And here are some \"fall pitchers.\"  Yeah, I know, they aren't the giant pitchers we were all expecting...the fall pitchers this year look almost like the spring pitchers, but with a little more color.<br/><br/>  This is a new addition to the collection and the division was rather small.  In any case, it definitely has some nice red pigment to it, and check out those circular globs of white pigment-it gives this clone some character.  Can't wait to see what this looks like when it has huge traps!<br/><br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_9191.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_9194.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_9192.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_9192.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>",
      "body_text": "And here are some \"fall pitchers.\"  Yeah, I know, they aren't the giant pitchers we were all expecting...the fall pitchers this year look almost like the spring pitchers, but with a little more color.\nThis is a new addition to the collection and the division was rather small.  In any case, it definitely has some nice red pigment to it, and check out those circular globs of white pigment-it gives this clone some character.  Can't wait to see what this looks like when it has huge traps!",
